{
  "name": "Search news and append rows to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## News to Google Sheets\n\n**What it does**\n\nRuns a Webz.io news search without an AI agent, splits each article into its own row, and appends those rows to a Google Sheet.\n\n**Who it's for**\n\nAnalysts and ops teams who want a simple scheduled or manual news feed they can share, filter, or chart in Sheets.\n\n**How it works**\n\n1. A manual trigger starts the workflow\n2. The **Settings** node holds the search query, result count, and lookback window\n3. **Webz.io News Search** calls the hosted MCP server and returns one item per article\n4. **Append rows** writes `title`, `url`, `published`, `score`, and `excerpt` into your sheet\n\n**Setup**\n\n1. Install the community node: `@webz.io/n8n-nodes-news-search`\n2. Create a **Webz.io News Search API** credential with your Webz.io token\n3. Connect **Append rows** to Google Sheets OAuth\n4. Update **Settings** with your query and sheet details\n\n**Customizing**\n\nOpen **Webz.io News Search → Additional Filters** for language, country, ticker, sentiment, and the rest. Put the search subject in **Query**, not in **Topic**.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-760, -120],
      "id": "c1d2e3f4-1111-4a01-9a01-000000000001",
      "name": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, 0],
      "id": "c1d2e3f4-1111-4a01-9a01-000000000002",
      "name": "Manual trigger"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1d2e3f4-1111-4a01-9a01-0000000000f1",
              "name": "query",
              "value": "central bank interest rate decisions",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1d2e3f4-1111-4a01-9a01-0000000000f2",
              "name": "limit",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1d2e3f4-1111-4a01-9a01-0000000000f3",
              "name": "days",
              "value": 7,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1d2e3f4-1111-4a01-9a01-0000000000f4",
              "name": "sheetId",
              "value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1d2e3f4-1111-4a01-9a01-0000000000f5",
              "name": "sheetName",
              "value": "News",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [-120, 0],
      "id": "c1d2e3f4-1111-4a01-9a01-000000000003",
      "name": "Settings"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "search",
        "query": "={{ $json.query }}",
        "limit": "={{ $json.limit }}",
        "simplify": true,
        "additionalFilters": {
          "days": "={{ $json.days }}",
          "language": [
            "english"
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "@webz.io/n8n-nodes-news-search.webzNewsSearch",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [120, 0],
      "id": "c1d2e3f4-1111-4a01-9a01-000000000004",
      "name": "Webz.io News Search",
      "credentials": {
        "webzNewsSearchApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Webz.io News Search API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').item.json.sheetId }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').item.json.sheetName }}"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "title": "={{ $json.title }}",
            "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
            "published": "={{ $json.published }}",
            "score": "={{ $json.score }}",
            "excerpt": "={{ $json.excerpt }}",
            "query": "={{ $json.query }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [360, 0],
      "id": "c1d2e3f4-1111-4a01-9a01-000000000005",
      "name": "Append rows",
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
